---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { REMOVAL_ADDRESS } from "../lib/launch.ts";
---

<Base>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">Code of Conduct</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">Effective date: 7 September 2026.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
      The Rupee Fund is a FOSS United community initiative run by community members. We adopt the
      conduct and anti-harassment standards of the{" "}
      <a
        href="https://fossunited.org/code-of-conduct"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-link">FOSS United Code of Conduct</a
      >, as reviewed on 7 September 2026, with the local rules below. Later changes to that source
      do not change this policy automatically. Where the source differs from the local rules, the
      local rules apply to Rupee Fund spaces.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">Scope and conduct</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
      These standards apply to contributors, applicants, volunteers, and organisers in Rupee Fund
      spaces and fund-related communications. Treat people with respect. Harassment, threats,
      discrimination, and disclosure of another person's private information are not permitted.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">Responsibility</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
      The <a href="/team" class="inline-link">community team</a> is responsible for conduct in Rupee Fund
      spaces. The Foundation contacts and event enforcement roles in the source policy are not assigned
      Rupee Fund responsibilities by this adoption. Foundation spaces remain subject to their own reporting
      procedures.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">Report a concern</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
      To report a concern in a Rupee Fund space, email{" "}
      <a href={`mailto:${REMOVAL_ADDRESS}`} class="inline-link">{REMOVAL_ADDRESS}</a>.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">Attribution</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-8">
      The adopted standards come from FOSS United. Its source credits the Major League Hacking
      policies under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 licence. This local adaptation
      uses the same <a
        href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-link">licence</a
      >.
    </p>
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Back to home</a>
  </div>
</Base>
